1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,930
These signs used to be people.

2
00:00:01,930 --> 00:00:02,460
I'm Mara.

3
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:05,790
I have fifty minutes, and
there is one blank board left.

4
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:09,250
Every sign on this
street was once a person.

5
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:09,780
Even me.

6
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,880
I was a bouncer,
forty years ago.

7
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:13,100
You? You're a cat.

8
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,310
The club was called the Cat.

9
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:15,290
I have no luck.

10
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:16,910
Fifty minutes left.

11
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:18,940
So I knocked on every name.

12
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:19,990
Ruth says run.

13
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:20,890
Otis says hide.

14
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:23,010
Pete says he left the oven on.

15
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,590
And what do you say?

16
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,060
I say, ask for help.

17
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,370
I don't do that.

18
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,330
I know. Nine years,
and not once.

19
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:33,560
Then, at the end of the row,
I found a board with no name.

20
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,530
Mara. It's already wired.

21
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,890
And it was exactly my size.

22
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:39,960
It's warming up.
It's warming up!

23
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,520
We ran for the door.

24
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,430
She was standing in front of it.

25
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,420
The other me.

26
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,050
Please. Move.

27
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:47,920
Mara, she has the key.

28
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:49,360
She looked me in the eye.

29
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,790
And she locked us in.
